  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Codex-native(默认路径)",
      "items": [
        "核心是 src/agent/runner.ts — 一个 thin harness around Codex",
        "工程模型:Excel intake → readiness → env profile → 双 turn runner → 交付结果",
        "故意不实现第二套页面语义/规划器/低智运行时"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "双 turn 设计",
      "items": [
        "turn 1:执行(无输出 schema,完整 agent 权限,无 tool call 不应失败)",
        "turn 2:同一 Run 上交付(codexTestResultSchema / src/agent/result.ts);容量或限流时会轮换物理线程,之后 --resume 继续同一 Run",
        "防止第一回合超大请求在调用前就爆"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "结果契约与 Mutation Ledger",
      "items": [
        "harness 校验:workflowId + sourceSha256 一致、每个 case 出现一次且有证据",
        "outcome 一致;product_failed 归因 product;blocked 必有 blocker",
        "Mutation Ledger 无 pending 条目;最多 --max-finalization-turns(默认 2)修正轮"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "回放与回归",
      "items": [
        "成功的 Codex-native run → src/compiler/mcp-replay.ts 编译成 Playwright 回归 spec",
        "legacy IR/Workflow Runtime/Planner/Recovery 路径已删除,不是 fallback",
        "架构迁移记录见 docs/architecture-journey-ir-runtime-to-codex-native.md"
      ]
    }
